# Zip A Folder With PowerShell For Staging In Temp - PowerShell | T1074.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_classic/posh_pc_susp_zip_compress.yml
source="WinEventLog:Windows PowerShell" (Data IN ("*Compress-Archive -Path*-DestinationPath $env:TEMP*", "*Compress-Archive -Path*-DestinationPath*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*", "*Compress-Archive -Path*-DestinationPath*:\\Windows\\Temp\\*"))
